# §242. What never goes to GitHub.

# ---- the admin credential -------------------------------------------------
# It lives in %LOCALAPPDATA%\ProTracker\Database\, not here. This entry is
# insurance in case a copy is ever dropped into the tree by hand.
admin-credential.json
**/admin-credential.json

# ---- build output ---------------------------------------------------------
# Regenerated on every build, and enormous. Nobody clones these.
[Bb]in/
[Oo]bj/
/publish/
.vs/
*.user
*.suo
*.userprefs

# ---- local machine state --------------------------------------------------
# The tracker writes these beside itself when it runs from the source folder.
*.db-shm
*.db-wal
events-admin-login.bin

# ---- notes that are mine, not the project's -------------------------------
# §247. MIGRATION_GUIDE.md is the engineering log - 246 sections describing the
# admin gate, the Worker's routes, how the credential is derived and every
# security tradeoff and its reasoning. None of it is a live secret, but it is a
# map of where to push, and the repository is public. It stays on disk. If it
# should be backed up and versioned, it wants a private repository of its own,
# not this one.
MIGRATION_GUIDE.md

# Removed from GitHub by hand. Without these lines the next "git add -A" puts
# them straight back.
Claude outputs/
sync-back-sprites.ps1

# Visual Studio writes this per machine.
settings.VisualStudio.json

# ---- local convenience ----------------------------------------------------
# The "Set Version" shortcuts that tools\version-shortcuts.ps1 scatters through
# the tree. Per-machine, and anyone who clones can make their own.
*.lnk

# ---- editors and operating systems ----------------------------------------
.idea/
.vscode/
Thumbs.db
ehthumbs.db
Desktop.ini
.DS_Store
